  "title": "Grilled Halloumi Kebabs",
  "description": "These vegetarian kebabs are delicious--halloumi cheese and tomatoes are threaded on skewers and marinated in a vinaigrette with basil and honey.",
  "authors": [
    "Soup Loving Nicole"
  ],
